{
  "sequence_id": "seq_ee880b9612205860",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Well...."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "His stubborn pride was dispelled!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I suppose confessing is the duty of the man..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "His thoughts became clouded,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "and a crack in his will was formed!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "This crack did not slip past shinomiya unnoticed!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SHE STRUCK!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I am at the age where I want to try falling in love, after all..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "#C.???!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "She approached it as she would a chess puzzle!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "As she closed in,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SHIROGANE SEARCH FRANTICALLY FOR HIS NEXT MOVE!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "As their thought processes were followed to their natural conclusion,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "A clear Victor emerged..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Oh,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "If you don't like romance movies,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I also have tickets to \"The Little Chicken.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "!?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Just because of the most"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Chaos theory!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "On the verge of completion,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "A perfect idea can have a single point of chaos introduced into it."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But that one point"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Can cause something as drastic as the big bang itself!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "In order to process the sudden appearance of this new option,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Their brains pushed themselves past their limits!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "??"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "UM..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Did I say some- thing wrong?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "The result..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Was a sudden desire for sugar to fuel their mental capabilities!!"
    }
  ],
